nd in the present, in order to produce knowledge to be disseminated in the school and scientific context. The research is a historical-epistemological study on mathematical creation, aimed at characterizing modes of stages of this creation focusing on the development of infinitesimal calculus and on the concept of function. At the end of the article, we propose educational guidelines for the teaching of these mathematical themes, based on the creation processes announced throughout the text."}]", "excerpt_truncated": true, "source_sha256": "a3ce963c295f5abe73408c52f7f382da3fe86eeaed510bcf02aa644437ac6e22", "verification_required": true, "topic_domain": "unassigned_problem", "evidence_role": "discovery", "host_tier": "discovery", "source_identity": null, "persistent_identifiers": ["doi:10.30687/978-88-6969-687-9/002", "doi:10.29333/iejme/10876", "openalex:W4367842545", "openalex:W7111939058", "openalex:W3158113288"], "source_candidates": ["https://doi.org/10.30687/978-88-6969-687-9/002", "https://doi.org/10.29333/iejme/10876"], "source_candidate_identities": {}}
